 ### SVGS with Tiny MLPs
-Uses a tiny three-layer neural network on each Gaussian surfel to map local coordinates to color and opacity. Strongest representation ability but significantly more parameters. Choose when maximum fidelity is required and parameter budget is less constrained. [Link](8729-spatially-varying-gaussian-splatting-svgs.md#tiny-mlps)
